WEBVTT

00:16:29.454 --> 00:16:31.412
and there's an Indigenous knowledge base

00:16:31.454 --> 00:16:34.246
that's basically untapped
because of the colonial structure

00:16:34.287 --> 00:16:35.829
that's been put everywhere.

00:16:35.871 --> 00:16:38.912
We need to be protecting people
in Africa and India

00:16:38.954 --> 00:16:42.204
and Southeast Asia and Australia,
New Zealand, Hawaii,

00:16:42.246 --> 00:16:43.954
South America, North America.

00:16:43.996 --> 00:16:45.287
We need to protect those.

00:16:45.329 --> 00:16:47.037
We need to be celebrating diversity

00:16:47.079 --> 00:16:49.871
instead of trying to build stupid walls
to keep people out.

00:16:49.912 --> 00:16:52.537
We need to have, you know,
healthy food access,

00:16:52.579 --> 00:16:53.954
cultural food producers,

00:16:53.996 --> 00:16:57.662
regional food systems,
local control of food systems,

00:16:57.704 --> 00:16:59.454
not governmental control,

00:16:59.496 --> 00:17:02.787
access to Indigenous education
and environmental protections